      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——我，是圣女红色梦想。\n终将到临“彼方之地”的宿命之人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "489454e447d8a370eee909ee8bfdf62348f3f937e51dcafa93f2282b0793d31e",
