      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想\n已经和几名马娘一起在奔跑了。\n那股气魄，简直惊天动地——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f426e85d7c3fd20772690b5cfaeac0af8903ee29f12d4916b1f79a5900353c8d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
